cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "VesuviusUNET tools: trace checks, ink inference and a phantom scroll benchmark"
version: 0.1.0
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Robinson
    given-names: Peter
repository-code: "https://github.com/pwrobinson70-netizen/vesuviusunet-pherc0139"
abstract: >-
  Command-line tools for checking traced papyrus surfaces (sheet spacing, sheet switches, centre line,
  combined audit), for running a trained 3-D U-Net over one traced segment, and a synthetic scroll with
  known ground truth for testing them. Validated on synthetic data only.
